---
title: Unpublished draft fixture
description: Unpublished by design — the end-to-end suite uses it to prove drafts stay out.
publishDate: 2026-01-01
draft: true
---

`draft: true` keeps this entry out of the feed, the blog index, the home page and
the route table — every consumer of the collection goes through `publishedPosts`.

`e2e/feed.spec.ts` reads the collection off disk and asserts the feed's item set
equals the published posts exactly. This file is what makes that assertion fail
if the draft filter ever stops being applied, so it is deliberately never
published.
